  "description": "EF Core-backed app-password store for Elarion (ADR-0111): the elarion_app_passwords table (the SHA-256 of each secret under a unique index, never the secret) on the database the application already runs, mapped onto its own DbContext through [GenerateElarionAppPasswords] or modelBuilder.UseElarionAppPasswords(). Change-tracker-free writes; the per-user cap and the last-use throttle hold across nodes.",
